    operator="managed by the Electronic Literature Lab at Washington State University Vancouver, with Dene Grigar as Managing Director and Curator, and supported by grants, donations and commissions; its About page says it 'was seeded by a grant from The Andrew W. Mellon Foundation and hosted through the generosity of the Electronic Textual Cultures Lab at the University of Victoria and Compute Canada' and is 'currently supported by Electronic Literature Organization, Washington State University Vancouver, and the Electronic Literature Lab', with funding from the Society of American Archivists and individual donors; the Electronic Literature Organization lists it among its Electronic Literature Archives; Wikipedia (third party) says it is supported by Washington State University at Vancouver and the Electronic Literature Organization",
