    count={"value": "48 collections (home page); over 3,000 works by 2022 (Wikipedia, third party); '30 collections and over 3000 works' (a project description of 2021, third party)", "as_of": "home page read 2026-11-01; works count 2022"},
    holdings=["48 collections of digital art and writing (home page)", "over 3,000 works by 2022, up from 30 collections of 2,500 works (Wikipedia)", "author collections, among them Hayles, Holeton, Joyce, Kendall, Kolb, Larsen, Luesebrink, Memmott, Moulthrop, Strickland and Zellen (Wikipedia)", "online journals: Iowa Review Web, BeeHive, Cauldron and Net, Poems That Go, Turbulence.org, The New River (Wikipedia)", "the Electronic Literature Collections (anthologies)", "re-created works such as Victory Garden (2022) and Uncle Buddy's Phantom Funhouse (2021) (Wikipedia)", "an expanded exhibition of Talan Memmott's 22 works of net art", "the ELO Works collection: 55 listed works from submissions to the 2001 Electronic Literature Awards and artists' donations, its materials shipped from MIT in July 2017"],
