    answers=["which collections, journals and author collections the museum holds", "under which published name, including a pen name, an author collection stands (Luesebrink as M.D. Coverley, per Wikipedia and the ELO Repository page)", "which works it has re-created from obsolete software", "its curatorial principle, as the project description states it: documenting 'a broad swath of human expression' without acting as gate-keeper, and 'a robust representation of born-digital literary output from the late 20th century onward'", "who seeded and supports it (its About page)"],
